OL,3,GNEWSABosses should have stopped gas
OL,4,Awork, trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior managers at an energy company
OL,7,Fshould have stepped in to stop work to
OL,8,Freconnect gas supplies to a block of
OL,9,Fflats before a fatal explosion, a trial
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FTen people were killed after the
OL,13,Fexplosion at Haut du Mont flats in
OL,14,FJersey on Saturday 10 December 2022.
OL,16,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, John Wright
OL,17,Fand Lee Ward, deny 10 counts of gross
OL,18,Fnegligence manslaughter while Island
OL,19,FEnergy has pleaded not guilty in a
OL,20,Fcombined health and safety case.
