OL,3,GNEWSABosses should have stopped gas
OL,4,Awork, trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence in the trial of Island
OL,7,FEnergy, gas expert Martin Wayland told
OL,8,Fthe Royal Court he would have expected
OL,9,Fsenior managers to have put off
OL,10,Frestoring supplies to look into an
OL,11,Fissue that occurred during work.
